      "notes": "MassGIS Level 3 (L3) Standardized Assessors' Parcel data, a single statewide service covering all 351 Massachusetts municipalities including all 6 target counties: Suffolk (Boston), Middlesex, Worcester, Norfolk, Essex, and Plymouth. Parcels are organized by municipality (TOWN_ID numeric code), not by county. To filter by county: Suffolk towns include Boston (274), Chelsea (54), Revere (223), Winthrop (349); Middlesex includes Cambridge (49), Lowell (168), Newton (195); use the MassGIS town-code lookup at mass.gov for the full list. Two-layer workflow: layer 1 (Tax Parcels) carries polygon geometry and parcel ID; layer 4 (L3_ASSESS table, no geometry) carries owner name, address, and assessment data, join on LOC_ID. OWNER_NAME field is public.",
